WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.560
Good morning John,

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:01.940
today I'm going to tell you the story

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.260
my shirt's inside out.

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:03.820
Good morning John,

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:05.040
today I'm going to tell you

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:07.020
the story of my ridiculous dog.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:08.240
My dog is named Lemon.

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:12.060
She is a bit of a...I'll put this delicately

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:13.440
a derp, for example

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.100
if she were a Pulitzer Prize winning novel she would be

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:16.960
"The Colour Derple."

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.400
If she were a sexually transmitted disease

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.480
she would be a herp-a-derpes simplex.

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.080
If she were a 19th century law man

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:23.120
she'd be Wyatt Derp.

00:00:23.120 --> 00:00:26.240
If she were a large species of Sub-Saharan African mammal

00:00:26.240 --> 00:00:27.960
she would be a herp-a-derp-a-pottamus.

00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.580
Lemon loves to get into cars

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:31.580
but hates to be inside of cars.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.300
She loves the little children's section of the playground.

00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:37.120
She hates dog toys, if she ever hears a toy squeak

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:40.340
she will never go within five feet of it ever again.

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:42.620
Greyhound's in general have oddly shaped bodies,

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:44.200
which makes it hard for them to sit down

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:45.220
like normal dogs.

00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:48.300
It also means it's har-, it's not comfortable to lay on their bellies,

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.040
so often times they lay on their backs.

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.380
We call this "The Roach."

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:53.540
She often sleeps with her eyes partially open

00:00:53.540 --> 00:00:56.700
and, uh, twitches while she's doing this,

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.280
which, uh, makes her look like a freaky zombie dog.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:00.980
The vocalizations of the Lemon

00:01:00.980 --> 00:01:02.100
are somewhat varied.

00:01:02.120 --> 00:01:04.440
She does bark, but only very rarely,

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.480
she much prefers to howl.

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:08.960
And her noises of patheticness are so

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:10.300
varied and nuanced

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:13.000
that she's earned the nickname "Lemonous Patheticus."

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:15.020
She's also afraid of the cat.

00:01:15.020 --> 00:01:16.860
Lemon's second favourite thing is to run

00:01:16.860 --> 00:01:18.960
because it, of course, is what she was bred to do.

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:22.300
Though she's getting a little older so she's not at her top speed anymore.

00:01:22.340 --> 00:01:25.860
On the track, her top speed was about 34 miles per hour,

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:28.540
0.3 miles in less than thirty seconds.

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:30.140
In addition to "Lemonous Patheticus"

00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:31.360
we also call her

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.800
Lemoncino, Lemoncello, Lemonpie

00:01:33.800 --> 00:01:34.760
Liz Lemon.

00:01:34.760 --> 00:01:36.520
That is, in fact, the reason why she is called Lemon.

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.380
Her track name was Tina Fey.

00:01:38.380 --> 00:01:39.940
Interesting thing about Greyhounds,

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:42.040
unlike every other kind of dog

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.760
you can actually go onto a website, search for their name

00:01:44.760 --> 00:01:46.380
and find out everything about them.

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:47.360
What their litter mates were named,

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:50.220
39 generations of previous sires,

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:52.560
brothers and sisters and half-brothers and half-sisters,

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.060
and every race they ever ran

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.160
and how they did.

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:56.500
It also shows you their ear tag numbers

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.300
which is totally strange to like see a number

00:01:58.300 --> 00:01:59.560
on a website

00:01:59.560 --> 00:02:01.620
and also tattooed on the inside of your dog's ear.

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:02.780
This one, on this ear

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:04.080
actually the five is the month she was born

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:06.180
and the four is the year she was born

00:02:06.180 --> 00:02:07.380
so we know that she was born

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.040
in May, 2004.

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:10.940
Through this website we learned all kinds of fascinating things

00:02:10.940 --> 00:02:12.520
like that all of Lemon's litter

00:02:12.520 --> 00:02:14.800
was named after 2004 cast of Saturday Night Live

00:02:14.820 --> 00:02:16.180
and that Will Ferrell, her brother

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:18.080
was the best, uh, racer of the litter

00:02:18.080 --> 00:02:19.700
winning 20 of his 63 races

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.880
and that Lemon's dad

00:02:20.880 --> 00:02:21.660
Craigy Whistler

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:25.000
sired over 5,000 racing dogs.

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:25.880
WHAT?

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:26.660
Of course, poor guy,

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.600
he wasn't actually there

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:29.380
for any of the conceptions.

00:02:29.380 --> 00:02:31.920
Virgin births, every one a virgin birth.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.600
Lemon is weary, or even afraid of

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:36.060
things that she hasn't experienced before

00:02:36.060 --> 00:02:37.040
and when we first got her

00:02:37.040 --> 00:02:40.920
pretty much everything was something that she hadn't experienced before.

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:44.720
Bicycles, rivers, breeds of dog that weren't greyhounds.

00:02:44.720 --> 00:02:46.140
Her introduction to the Green household

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:47.340
was a very confusing time for her

00:02:47.340 --> 00:02:48.020
but the one thing

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:49.160
that she took to immeadiately

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:51.860
was her third favourite thing, after food and running

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:53.520
and that's cuddling.

00:02:53.520 --> 00:02:55.540
And she is just a cuddle bear

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:57.040
and we love her very much.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.980
And if you are at all interested in getting a dog

00:02:58.980 --> 00:03:01.360
you should check your local area

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:03.320
for, uh, greyhound adoption agencies.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:05.100
There are lots that need homes.

00:03:05.100 --> 00:03:06.940
My foot's asleep, my foot's asleep.

